OL,3,ATrump says Musk has restored Ukraine's
OL,4,Ainternet access
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has restored Ukraine's
OL,7,Finternet access, Donald Trump has said.
OL,9,FThe US president was speaking hours
OL,10,Fafter Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,11,FZelensky said connectivity, which is
OL,12,Fprovided by Musk's satellite-based
OL,13,FStarlink system, had yet to be fully
OL,14,Frestored.
OL,16,FMusk has previously denied he was
OL,17,Fbehind the slowdown, which affects
OL,18,FUkraine's ability to use drones to
OL,19,Fattack Russia.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
