OL,3,ACrowd of 50 beats foreigner to death in
OL,4,ASouth Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe killing follows a wave of protests
OL,7,Fagainst immigrants in South Africa this
OL,8,Fyear, some of which have turned
OL,9,Fviolent. Earlier this month, shops and
OL,10,Fcars were set on fire in Durban, as
OL,11,Fwell as Soweto, near Johannesburg.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
